<title>UK: SOCCER-REVISED ENGLISH F.A. CUP DRAW.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-REVISED ENGLISH F.A. CUP DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Revised English F.A. Cup draw after</p>
<p>matches on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Fourth round - Saturday, Feb 15: Blackburn v Coventry</p>
<p>Fifth round - Saturday, Feb 15: Leeds v Portsmouth,</p>
<p>Birmingham v Wrexham, Chesterfield v Nottingham Forest,</p>
<p>Manchester City or Watford v Middlesbrough, Wimbledon v Queens</p>
<p>Park Rangers.</p>
<p>Sunday, Feb 16: Bradford City v Sheffield Wednesday,</p>
<p>Leicester v Chelsea.</p>
<p>Wednesday, Feb 26: Derby v Blackburn or Coventry.</p>
</text>
